# Bluetooth Protocol (Zhiyun Smooth 4)

Technical notes for anyone who wants to understand or improve the project. Each item indicates whether it is verified or not.

**Legend:** ✅ verified · 🟡 likely · ❓ not verified

---

## 1. Connection

| What | Value | Status |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Service** | `fee9` (`0000fee9-0000-1000-8000-00805f9b34fb`) | 🟡 used by the Weebill-S, same family |
| **Write (without response)** | `d44bc439-abfd-45a2-b575-925416129600` | ✅ |
| **Notifications** | `d44bc439-abfd-45a2-b575-925416129601` and `...9610` | ✅ they exist |

> **Note:** The gimbal accepts only one connection at a time. Close the official Zhiyun app before connecting.

